&lt;li&gt;Experience with inventory management and supply planning in a manufacturing or hardware environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operationalize new processes, tools, or purchasing models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and ability to influence stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering results; experience driving measurable revenue or efficiency impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
