&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6b0jm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1125&quot;&gt;Process payroll cycles across multiple regions, ensuring accuracy and timeliness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rvz91o&quot; data-start=&quot;1126&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;Manage payroll inputs, calculations, adjustments, and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
