&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t1eg76&quot; data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;532&quot;&gt;None&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;r96749&quot; data-start=&quot;884&quot; data-end=&quot;945&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;887&quot; data-end=&quot;945&quot;&gt;Your Role: Own Conversion Content That Drives Pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;947&quot; data-end=&quot;1132&quot;&gt;As a Demand Generation Content Manager at emnify, you will own one of the most critical gaps in our current go-to-market: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1131&quot;&gt;conversion-focused content that turns demand into pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;Today, we already produce strong thought leadership content — but what we need now is someone who can execute on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1247&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;high-impact, demand generation content that performs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;Embedded within the Demand Generation team, your mission is to create and scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1386&quot; data-end=&quot;1441&quot;&gt;content that directly drives activation and revenue&lt;/strong&gt; across paid campaigns, landing pages, and key website journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1676&quot;&gt;This is not a brand or editorial role. It’s a hands-on, execution-focused role for someone who knows how to take direction, move fast, and deliver content that converts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1678&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1cvahlj&quot; data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1686&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;Why emnify? / Why This Role Exists&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qtf7z9&quot; data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;This role is a direct investment in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1822&quot;&gt;closing a critical gap in our demand generation engine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wo4mzk&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;You will complement existing thought leadership with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1880&quot; data-end=&quot;1931&quot;&gt;performance-driven content that drives pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1x6jm0m&quot; data-start=&quot;1934&quot; data-end=&quot;2028&quot;&gt;A highly collaborative setup across Demand Gen, Paid Media, Product Marketing, and Revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cszsox&quot; data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2117&quot;&gt;A company with strong product-market fit, where better conversion = immediate impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gzno7&quot; data-start=&quot;2118&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;A culture that values &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2142&quot; data-end=&quot;2199&quot;&gt;execution, speed, and measurable outcomes over theory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;gnc7yu&quot; data-start=&quot;2059&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2062&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2640&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;194p1w5&quot; data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2185&quot;&gt;Own and execute conversion-focused content across paid channels, landing pages, and lifecycle programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18p6idz&quot; data-start=&quot;2186&quot; data-end=&quot;2277&quot;&gt;Partner with Demand Gen and Paid Media to launch and optimize high-performing campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qyuwld&quot; data-start=&quot;2278&quot; data-end=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;Lead ongoing experimentation through A/B testing of messaging, creatives, and page structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cx4z0&quot; data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2462&quot;&gt;Improve conversion across the funnel:&lt;br data-start=&quot;2415&quot; data-end=&quot;2418&quot;&gt;Visitor → Lead&lt;br data-start=&quot;2432&quot; data-end=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;Lead → Qualified pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ne2f4&quot; data-start=&quot;2463&quot; data-end=&quot;2566&quot;&gt;Translate complex IoT and connectivity topics into clear, compelling, and high-converting messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w112up&quot; data-start=&quot;2567&quot; data-end=&quot;2640&quot;&gt;Use performance data to continuously refine strategy and maximize ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2642&quot; data-end=&quot;2645&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1hi0l42&quot; data-start=&quot;2647&quot; data-end=&quot;2668&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2650&quot; data-end=&quot;2668&quot;&gt;What We Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2670&quot; data-end=&quot;3098&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vw6hfd&quot; data-start=&quot;2670&quot; data-end=&quot;2735&quot;&gt;4–7+ years in B2B content, growth, or demand generation roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16x74ww&quot; data-start=&quot;2736&quot; data-end=&quot;2827&quot;&gt;Proven experience creating conversion-focused content (not just blogs or brand content)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jj1mp9&quot; data-start=&quot;2828&quot; data-end=&quot;2955&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of:&lt;br data-start=&quot;2854&quot; data-end=&quot;2857&quot;&gt;Paid acquisition (LinkedIn, Google, Meta, etc.)&lt;br data-start=&quot;2904&quot; data-end=&quot;2907&quot;&gt;Landing page optimization&lt;br data-start=&quot;2932&quot; data-end=&quot;2935&quot;&gt;B2B buyer journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16yjnoe&quot; data-start=&quot;2956&quot; data-end=&quot;3029&quot;&gt;Ability to simplify technical topics into clear, compelling messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13vrk6b&quot; data-start=&quot;3030&quot; data-end=&quot;3098&quot;&gt;Data-driven mindset – fluent in working with performance metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3100&quot; data-end=&quot;3103&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;16dcokl&quot; data-start=&quot;3105&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3108&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
