&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hf9yp2&quot; data-start=&quot;3126&quot; data-end=&quot;3196&quot;&gt;Experience in IoT, telecom, SaaS, or developer/technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yn6z4o&quot; data-start=&quot;3197&quot; data-end=&quot;3287&quot;&gt;Familiarity with tools like HubSpot, LinkedIn Campaign Manager, Google Analytics, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
