&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3342&quot; data-end=&quot;3345&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;x66ktu&quot; data-start=&quot;3347&quot; data-end=&quot;3381&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3350&quot; data-end=&quot;3381&quot;&gt;Why This Might Not Be a Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3383&quot; data-end=&quot;3708&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f8q71&quot; data-start=&quot;3383&quot; data-end=&quot;3468&quot;&gt;You prefer brand, storytelling, or editorial content over performance-driven work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ij4hiu&quot; data-start=&quot;3469&quot; data-end=&quot;3560&quot;&gt;You’re not comfortable being measured on conversion rates, pipeline, and revenue impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19bmlfd&quot; data-start=&quot;3561&quot; data-end=&quot;3634&quot;&gt;You haven’t worked closely with paid media or demand generation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;155ouwf&quot; data-start=&quot;3635&quot; data-end=&quot;3708&quot;&gt;You’re looking for a purely creative role without data accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3710&quot; data-end=&quot;3713&quot;&gt;
