techaviv-betterhelp:greenhouse:409588900.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BetterHelp – Werde Teil der weltweit führenden Plattform für psychologische Online-Beratung&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei BetterHelp ist es unsere Mission, Barrieren abzubauen und emotionale Unterstützung zugänglicher zu machen. Seit 2013 haben über 5 Millionen Menschen weltweit unsere Plattform für psychologische Online-Beratung und Coaching genutzt. Jetzt sind wir in Deutschland gestartet – und suchen qualifizierte psychologische Berater:innen, die Teil unseres Netzwerks werden möchten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum BetterHelp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wachsendes Netzwerk unterstützen:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hilf mit, den Zugang zu psychologischer Beratung in ganz Deutschland zu erweitern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alles auf einer Plattform:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Konzentrier dich auf deine Klient:innen – wir übernehmen Akquise, Abrechnung, Terminplanung und Administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Volle Flexibilität:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Gestalte deinen Arbeitsalltag und -ort komplett flexibel und selbstbestimmt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fokus auf das Wesentliche:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Verbringe deine Zeit mit der Unterstützung deiner Klient:innen – unsere Tools und unser Team kümmern sich um den Rest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Care inklusive:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Berater:innen auf BetterHelp erhalten kostenlosen Zugang zur Plattform zur eigenen Nutzung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attraktive Vergütung:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Verdiene wettbewerbsfähige Honorare – plus 1.000  € Bonus, wenn du innerhalb von 30 Tagen nach deiner Bewerbung deine erste Klient:in unterstützt. (Bonus kann variieren. Bedingungen gelten.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wen wir suchen:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrene Fachkräfte mit abgeschlossenem Master- oder Diplomabschluss in Psychologie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindestens 3 Jahre Erfahrung in der psychologischen Beratung von Erwachsenen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation, hochwertige Beratung in einem rein digitalen Setting anzubieten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Möglichkeit, Online-Sitzungen aus einer ruhigen, privaten Umgebung durchzuführen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deutschkenntnisse auf muttersprachlichem Niveau (mündlich und schriftlich)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft, ein polizeiliches Führungszeugnis zu übermitteln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wichtig zu wissen:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Es handelt sich nicht um eine psychotherapeutische Tätigkeit im Sinne des deutschen Psychotherapeutengesetzes (PsychThG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Berater:innen arbeiten auf freiberuflicher Basis – nicht als Angestellte von BetterHelp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BetterHelp bietet keine klinische Behandlung, Diagnosen oder medizinische Versorgung an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Psychologische Berater:innen sind keine Angestellten von BetterHelp, sondern selbstständige Dienstleister:innen. Die Verwendung des Begriffs „Bonus“ bezieht sich auf eine Vergütung für selbstständige Berater:innen. Sie impliziert kein Angestelltenverhältnis und begründet keinen Anspruch auf Leistungen für Mitarbeitende.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

techaviv-taboola:greenhouse:7975988.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Talent Acquisition Business Partner &lt;/strong&gt;on the &lt;strong&gt;Taboola&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Talent Acquisition team&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Tel Aviv Office&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll play a vital role in &lt;strong&gt;hiring for top Tech positions that drives Taboola’s technology and business success while building trusted partnerships with hiring managers to shape our future teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead end-to-end recruitment processes, directly impact our Tech Org growth, and act as a strategic partner to the business – ensuring we hire exceptional people who advance our mission and culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To thrive in this role, you’ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s Degree in Behavioral Sciences&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of in-house recruitment experience for technical positions within a global company&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record managing full-cycle recruitment processes independently&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sourcing skills with creative talent engagement approaches&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and excellent communication skills&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in hyper-growth tech environments&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with progressing AI recruitment tools and data-driven hiring&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Talent Acquisition Business Partner&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll bring value by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing end-to-end recruitment processes for Tech roles, from brief to offer acceptance&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a trusted business partner to hiring managers, providing strategic advice to build high-performing teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving proactive sourcing strategies to build a strong and diverse pipeline of candidates&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting in-depth interviews to assess technical skills, cultural fit, and growth potential&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering an outstanding candidate experience that reflects Taboola’s culture and values&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to employer branding initiatives to strengthen our positioning in the talent market&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Taboola?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you ask Taboolars what they love about working here, they’ll tell you that they’ve been empowered to realize their full potential while growing and learning from and with smart and talented people. They’ll also share more about:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy comprehensive benefits, a fully stocked kitchen, and location-specific perks (gym partnerships, parking).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid work schedule with 3 days in-office, with the option to come in more often if desired.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with some of the biggest names:&lt;/strong&gt; Our publisher partners include Yahoo, Conde Nast, Fox Sports, NBCU, ESPN, CBS, and E! Online. Our advertiser clients include Wells Fargo, Honda, Pinterest, Expedia, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to realize your potential?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola is an equal opportunity employer and we value diversity in all forms. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees, believing it is critical for success. Employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about #TaboolaLife on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/all/?fetchDeterministicClustersOnly=true&amp;amp;heroEntityKey=urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A128707&amp;amp;keywords=taboola&amp;amp;origin=RICH_QUERY_SUGGESTION&amp;amp;position=2&amp;amp;searchId=dcc8bfbb-b05c-458e-a7f1-726d30e7dd80&amp;amp;sid=9(y&amp;amp;spellCorrectionEnabled=false&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/taboola/&quot;&gt; Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/taboola.israel/?hl=en&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BctKkw2Vj_EOjvy24kjRKq_ZxZzmZxweIqNLQgsLtcs/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt; X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6W0hdStO0jRVYhg4ABzjRw&quot;&gt; YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, &amp;amp; the&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.taboola.com/category/taboola-life/?_gl=1*1c2v1ec*_ga*MTI4NTM3OTcyNy4xNjkxNTA0MjA0*_ga_ERHENNM7DM*MTcxMDM1MDIwMi4yMjMuMS4xNzEwMzUwMjI5LjMzLjAuMA..&quot;&gt; Taboola Life Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Taboola&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola empowers businesses to grow through performance advertising technology that goes beyond search and social and delivers measurable outcomes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Taboola works with thousands of businesses who advertise directly on Realize, Taboola’s powerful ad platform, reaching approximately 600M daily active users across some of the best publishers in the world. Publishers like NBC News, Yahoo, and OEMs such as Samsung, Xiaomi and others use Taboola’s technology to grow audience and revenue, enabling Realize to offer unique data, specialized algorithms, and unmatched scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid &lt;br&gt;#LI-LTD1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

techchange-one-acre-fund:greenhouse:7964.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h3&gt;About One Acre Fund&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2006, One Acre Fund equips 5.5 million smallholder farmers to make their farms more productive. Across nine countries that together are home to two-thirds of Africa&#39;s farmers, we provide high-quality farm supplies, tree seedlings, accessible credit, modern agronomic training, and a wide range of other agricultural services. On average, this model enables any farmer to increase their income and assets on supported land by more than 35 percent, while permanently improving their resilience. This is all made possible by our team of 9,000+ full-time staff, drawn from diverse backgrounds and professions.&amp;nbsp;To learn more, please see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://oneacrefund.org/careers/why-work-here&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Why Work Here&lt;/a&gt; blog post.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Malawi program, founded in 2016, provides more than 670,000 farmers with quality farm supplies and training. Our office in Malawi is located in Zomba, in the country’s south. One Acre Fund works in Malawi’s southern region, which has the highest concentration of smallholder farmers in the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seeking a passionate professional with 5+ years of strategic and operational experience to lead Malawi&#39;s Impact team, co-define country strategy, manage R&amp;amp;D trials, and scale market access buybacks to directly increase smallholder farmers&#39; resilience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Management of the HQ Impact team (~25&lt;em&gt;% of bandwidth&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage 3 or 4 direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct weekly check-ins providing them with enough feedback to help them continuously improve their overall performance, with stretching projects to expand their professional growth and meaningful contributions to our programs’ impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write semi annual thorough and well-calibrated individual PDRs and goals, as well as promotion plans or performance improvement plan when appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously review and update the impact team’s org chart, roles and responsibilities, proactively restructuring and hiring as needed per programs’ evolution, ensuring clear alignment between teammates’ role and growth path with their performance and growth potential, as well as our programs’ impact priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define annual budget related to Impact activities and keep close track of Budget-vs-Actuals to keep it at a minimum level, ensuring grant-funded projects are clearly labelled and assigned to respective grants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improvement of the core program impact through Excellent Extension(~25% of bandwidth)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategize, Prioritize &amp;amp; Plan&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set our country impact strategy together with FOPs Lead, MEL Lead and Country Director, translating it into annual FOPs impact goals and workplan, deriving in individual goals for the Impact HQ and field team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Global Impact to incorporate org-wide impact priorities, including Excellent Extension, deciding what to do but as importantly what &lt;em&gt;NOT &lt;/em&gt;to do after realistic consideration of in-country bandwidth constraints and focus needs to ensure we remain impactful and don’t dilute our limited resources into too many different directions that would reduce our overall team’s efficiency and programs’ impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Coordinate &amp;amp; Communicate&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Split responsibilities and follow-up closely with very limited need for manager support to ensure successful and timely execution of all impact initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead compelling communication with the field team on all impact activities, actively preparing and facilitating discussions during Field Leader and AFD meetings, highlighting key messages in talking points for Monday Meetings, sending frequent encouraging messages in WhatsApp groups to enhance momentum around impact activities; single-messaging through multi-channeling and repetitions should be considered as best practice to make a message stick&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Assess &amp;amp; Improve&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with MEL to evaluate our annual and long-term impact, planning and following up on impact assessment and analysis to ensure we focus our resources on the most impactful initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systematically challenge status quo and seek how we can provide more impact more effectively, getting inspiration from other countries as well as other organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor impact performance by setting KPIs, dashboards etc. and use them to drive accountability and results towards our targets during weekly field meetings (FL, AFD, Monday)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the way our agricultural training are designed and delivered with a strong Excellent Extension strategy that is realistically actionable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sort out and schedule annual training curriculum by removing some and adding new depending on the needs identified, in line with our seasonal impact priorities&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct improvement and execution of planting, top-dressing, IPM training and SBC initiatives. in the most effective way, using critical thinking and post-mortem to make iterations season after season; decision to NOT repeat an initiative because of negative results can be an effective way to focus on the most impactful activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Innovations of practices and products via R&amp;amp;D trials (~&lt;em&gt;25% of bandwidth&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impactful Practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-identify key yield drivers to be tested (spacing, micro dosing etc.) and focus on crops with the biggest yield gap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-define trial set up through partners or clients in a lean manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise execution of yield improvement trials&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-analyze results and prescribe recommendations on way forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impactful Products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay closely connected to farmers’ needs and preferences by regularly conducting farmer needs assessments through field visits, MEL survey data, qualitative research etc. as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, select and trial new impactful products in line with country priorities and resources, focusing on products with the highest SROI potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise sourcing, troubleshooting and impact measurement of all new impactful products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impactful Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategy, implement and analyze sustainability of new service trials (e.g.: buy-back), focusing on services with the highest SROI potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale and boost adoption of the most impactful products (legumes, trees etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect feedback from the field team and advise on which products should be scaled to bring more impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Client Acquisition team to prepare and execute compelling marketing materials to boost adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Display autonomous product ownership from identification to distribution on all agricultural products,&amp;nbsp; including liaising with Global Sourcing &amp;amp; LOG and proactively follow up on all agricultural products procurement to ensure impactful products are delivered in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise effective implementation of Social Behavior Change initiatives in line with the program’s new impact priorities (climate change adaptation, soil health etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Career Growth and Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have a strong culture of constant learning and we invest in developing our people. You’ll have weekly check-ins with your manager, access to mentorship and training programs, and regular feedback on your performance. We hold career reviews every six months, and set aside time to discuss your aspirations and career goals. You’ll have the opportunity to shape a growing organization and build a rewarding long-term career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Across all roles, these are the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://oneacrefund.org/work-with-us/application-process/qualifications/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;general qualifications we look for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; For this role specifically, you will have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate, Impact-Driven, Hard-Working, Result-Oriented individual that can 100% align with OAF’s values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team management: nurture high accountability on results across the HQ and field impact team, ensuring people are being celebrated and challenged as needed to maximize programs&#39; impact, practicing radical candor with care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management:&amp;nbsp; be capable of designing and leading medium to large projects with a high degree of independence and ability to navigate ambiguity with little manager support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity to prioritize and push back when need be: this role is best suited for candidates who have a particularly strong capacity to “say no” gatekeeping key program priorities from internal and external solicitations requesting to do additional activities which could compromise our team capacity to achieve our main Impact goals; ability to prioritize and differentiate “must do” from “nice to have” activities to sustain and grow our programs impact is critical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning /work smart: create and execute your own work plans independently&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis:&amp;nbsp; moderate or high&amp;nbsp; data analytical ability for decision making&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication and relationship management:&amp;nbsp; Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to coordinate across country teams and generate enthusiasm for global projects and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Start Date&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As soon as possible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Job Location&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Zomba, Malawi Lilongwe, Malawi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Health insurance, housing, and comprehensive benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Eligibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One Acre Fund can support a work permit for this role. However, nationals of (or those with an extensive professional background and work history in) our countries of operation are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Application Deadline&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;28 August 2026. Please note that we hire on a rolling basis which means that applications are reviewed and processed on a continuous basis until a hire is made.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;One Acre Fund never asks candidates to pay any money or pay for tests at any stage of the interview process. Official One Acre Fund emails will always arrive from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://oneacrefund.org/&quot;&gt;oneacrefund.org&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;address. Please report any suspicious communication here (&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:globalhotline@oneacrefund.org&quot;&gt;globalhotline@oneacrefund.org&lt;/a&gt;),&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;but do not send applications or application materials to this email address.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion (DEI), and anti-racism are deeply connected to our organization’s mission and purpose. One Acre Fund aspires to build a culture where all staff feel consistently valued, represented, and connected – so that our team can thrive as professionals, and achieve exceptional impact for the farmers we serve.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability, gender, gender identity or expression. We are proud to be an equal opportunity workplace.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

usv-tucows:greenhouse:7702005003.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;Ting Internet is a leading fiber Internet provider in the United States, delivering future-proof internet in over a dozen Ting Towns across the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Tucows (NASDAQ:TCX, TSX:TC), Ting is backed by outstanding resources and talent. We embrace a people-first philosophy that is rooted in respect, trust, and flexibility. We believe that whatever works for our employees is what works best for us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The work we do genuinely changes lives. If this sounds exciting, we’d love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Ting Internet in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Thornton, CO&lt;/strong&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;100% commission-based Direct Sales Representative / Ting Internet Promoter&lt;/strong&gt;. Our &lt;strong&gt;Fast Start Training Program&lt;/strong&gt; helps you earn while you learn and sets you up for success from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Walk and sell in local neighborhoods, engaging with your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate homeowners about Ting’s ultra-fast fiber internet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers sign up on the spot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track leads and progress on a company-provided tablet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Ting with professionalism, enthusiasm, and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed weekly sales goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hear from our current team about what it’s like:&lt;a href=&quot;https://storiesfromtheherd.com/a-day-in-the-life-of-a-ting-internet-field-sales-representative-1b2bb1470874&quot;&gt; A Day in the Life&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get paid while you ramp up! &lt;/strong&gt;Through our Fast Start Sales Program, you can earn up to $4,800 in Training Incentives during your first 8 weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncapped Commission&lt;/strong&gt; – top reps earn $70,000–$220,000+ annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gas &amp;amp; mileage support and company gear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, outdoor-focused work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic, self-driven, and goal-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy connecting with people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working outside, evenings, and weekends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliable transportation and a valid driver’s license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No prior telecom sales experience? We’ll train the right personality!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why Join Ting?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re moving on from retail, food service, or just want control over your income, this is a launchpad to a fulfilling career. You’ll be part of a supportive team, promoting a product people truly love, with the potential to grow fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Start strong. Earn early. Grow fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take the next step; &lt;/strong&gt;apply now and start getting paid what you’re worth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about what we stand for? At Ting Internet and Tucows we care about protecting the open Internet, narrowing the digital divide, and supporting fairness and equality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also know that diversity drives innovation. We are committed to inclusion across race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status or disability status. We celebrate multiple approaches and diverse points of view.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform crucial job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment. Please contact us to request an accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use AI-enabled tools throughout our recruitment process to help us work more efficiently and consistently. These tools support our hiring teams by organizing and reviewing information, while final hiring decisions are always made by people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tucows and its subsidiaries participate in the E-verify program for all US employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/Df2-LF0enpQ&quot;&gt;What&#39;s new at Tucows&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about Tucows, our businesses, culture and employee benefits on our site&lt;a href=&quot;https://tucows.com/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-JL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
